    "detailed_description": "Skirmishers is a Real Time Strategy game, unlike most of the RTS, you can only control <strong>ONE</strong> character directly who can rally others around him and command them march together or fight alongside him.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Available in English and Spanish languages. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Rally all nearby units to follow you, and your orders. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use the Attack command to order you and your warriors to attack a specific target. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use Solo Mode to stop commanding your units and attack or go to the destination alone. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Use Aggressive Stance to command all units to attack their nearest target on sight. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Capture buildings to produce resources and train units to bolster your army. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create special unique units with unique spells and abilities at your command. </li></ul>",
